#: ../../inochi2d/about.rst:3 10b45c53028546908c882ba6f58a67c1
msgid "About Inochi2D"
msgstr "關於 Inochi2D"

#: ../../inochi2d/about.rst:5 17cf7f04947f40ac920154a8cfbabf42
msgid ""
"Inochi2D is a library for realtime 2D puppet animation and the reference "
"implementation of the Inochi2D Puppet standard."
msgstr ""
"Inochi2D 為一個即時模擬 2D 模型的程式庫及 Inochi2D 角色的參考實作 (reference "
"implementation)。"

#: ../../inochi2d/about.rst:6 dea96398b4084738acb57a01aff22a2d
msgid ""
"It works by deforming 2D meshes created from layered art at runtime based on "
"parameters, this deformation tricks the viewer in to seeing 3D depth and "
"movement in the 2D art."
msgstr ""
"透過參數控制，讓圖層化藝術素材 (layered art) 生成出的 2D 網格在執行時變形，產生"
"錯覺，使觀看者可以在 2D 藝術中感受到 3D 的空間深度。"

#: ../../inochi2d/about.rst:8 be132c7003004d82ad010e9c29469184
msgid ""
"The Inochi2D Project provides official tools for manipulating and using these "
"models for VTubing, via :doc:`Inochi Creator </creator/about>` "
"and :doc:`Inochi Session </session/index>`."
msgstr ""
"Inochi2D 專案透過 \\ :doc:`Inochi Creator </creator/about>`\\  以及 "
"\\ :doc:`Inochi Session </session/index>`\\  提供使用者操控及使用這些模型的官方"
"工具。"

#: ../../inochi2d/about.rst:10 cd9760003f9349b79777340034f743fa
msgid ""
"The Inochi2D section covers the specification for implementing your own "
"instance of Inochi2D, if you wish to know more about the API of the Inochi2D D "
"package, see the `dpldocs page <https://inochi2d.dpldocs.info/v0.7.2/"
"inochi2d.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"Inochi2D 區塊涵蓋了實作 Inochi2D 實例的相關規範，如果你想要知道更多 Inochi2D D "
"套件的 API，請參閱 \\ `dpldocs 頁面 <https://inochi2d.dpldocs.info/v0.7.2/"
"inochi2d.html>`__\\。"
